----------------------------------------------------
 Finalize GroupAggregate
   Group Key: fk
   ->  Gather
         Workers Planned: 2
         ->  Parallel Custom Scan (LionCount)
               Lion Indexes: lion_bkf_fk (fk = d.k)
               Join Type: Semi
               Join Keys: distinct, sorted
               Join Key Lookups: in index order
               ->  Seq Scan on lion_bkdn d
                     Filter: (attr = 1)
(11 rows)

